msgid "You have already registered the Secure Boot MOK."
msgstr "您已註冊安全啟動 MOK。"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:449
msgid "Install akmods-evernight"
msgstr "安裝 akmods-evernight"

#: src/driverpage.cpp:450
msgid ""
"akmods-evernight is required to generate and enroll the Secure Boot MOK.\n"
"It is not installed yet. Install it first and then continue with MOK "
"registration?"
msgstr ""
"產生並註冊安全啟動 MOK 需要 akmods-evernight。\n"
"該套件尚未安裝，是否先安裝它，然後繼續註冊 MOK？"

